60/extras/8d75890306746f0c9328f4997dcaeac3.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/8d75890306746f0c9328f4997dcaeac3.webm?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/8d75890306746f0c9328f4997dcaeac3.mp4?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Dungeon Crawling! </h2><br>Explore a ruined kingdom brimming with hidden secrets and puzzles!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/4706a94d6a769cd8df494283318e2d4a.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/4706a94d6a769cd8df494283318e2d4a.webm?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/4706a94d6a769cd8df494283318e2d4a.mp4?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Upgrade Your Turrets &amp; Traps! </h2><br>Each has its own upgrade tree with 100+ upgrades in all!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.poster.avif?t=1739900841\" width=500 height=280 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.webm?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1132760/extras/420a6336c2bf6caabb7a508e85735cd0.mp4?t=1739900841\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Fight Epic Boss Battles! </h2><br